  "claim_sources": {
    "2f0c232d": "Save v9_2 submission with garrison defense fallback\n\nInclude station-aware travel, decision reporting, offensive flag step safety, and garrison hold or retreat when full defense reservations cannot be met.\n\nBuild completed. Cycle 2 development Y results: 17/24 wins versus 15/24 previously. Fresh validation was stopped at user request; response measurements exceeded 200ms, so final acceptance remains pending. Preserve this checkpoint without binaries, replays, or submission ZIPs.\n\n",
    "9ee30c71": "Add v9 (v9-lock) submission source and v9 / v9_2 submission ZIPs\n\nv9-lock: v8 + score-aware endgame (LOCK when leading, ALLIN when trailing),\nstation-aware travel times, all-or-nothing defence allocation, randomized\nweak-spot attacks, --trace=<file> decision report (local only).\nNot yet validated in matches after the latest change.\n\nv9_2 ZIP matches submissions/v9_2 already on main (7d96f62a).\n\n",
    "0e352edc": "v9: uncap pre-endgame escorted-raid defence, add endgame mode hysteresis\n\n- deadline_guard: drop the need<=4 cap; an escorted HALL/ENG raid is answered whenever\n  enough W can arrive in time (still all-or-nothing, still at most 2 buildings per turn).\n- Endgame modes: ALLIN only when trailing by >=3, or losing with <=4 turns left;\n  once ALLIN, return to LOCK only with a lead >=3. New COUNTER mode for -2..0:\n  defensive reservations kept, all-in script added to the search as a counterattack.\n\nBased on v9 Y-side losses in 5 local leagues (blown leads flip-flopped LOCK/ALLIN;\npre-140 collapses lost HALL 1:3). Built and ZIP-inspected; not yet validated in matches.\n\n",
    "a21e4809": "Merge v9_2 defense checkpoint while preserving remote updates\n\nRetain checkpoint 2f0c232d with incomplete validation and response-time concerns. Only submissions/v9_2/v9_strategy.hpp changes relative to remote main.\n\n"
  },
